<title>USA: Rubbermaid Inc Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Rubbermaid Inc Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>WOOSTER, Ohio 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31	     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales				  601,688	    533,285</p>
<p> Cost of sales			    432,579	    365,954</p>
<p> Gross profit			     169,109	    167,331</p>
<p> SG&amp;A expenses			    103,363	     95,485</p>
<p> Other charges (credits), net	  11,044		4,841</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes	  54,702	     67,005</p>
<p> Income taxes				20,677	     25,328</p>
<p> Net earnings				34,025	     41,677</p>
<p> NET EPS (Note A)		    $	.23	 $	.27</p>
<p>	  (Dollars in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: (A)  Based on average shares outstanding of 149,898,930 and 153,943,097 for the respective 1997 and 1996 three-month periods ending March 31.  </p>
<p>First Call analysts' consensus estimate $0.22.</p>
</text>
